# Integration files are pre-generated and committed so users can clone + install
# without running the converter. Contributors regenerate with scripts/convert.sh
# after adding or modifying agents.
# Claude Code: machine-local files. These can contain approved shell commands
# with passwords, tokens or keys, so they must never be committed.
# Shared files such as .claude/settings.json and .claude/skills/ stay tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json
